  [2m▎[0m [3mthe response are part of the contract; changes go through a versioned endpoint.[0m

  So a straight rename breaks three live consumers — including shipped iOS builds you can't update in lockstep — and
  contradicts the stated versioning policy. The rename itself is one line; the fallout isn't.

